# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) from Rolanberry Fields [S], the four Large Memory Fragments held: the Cavernous Maw plays 703
# [1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1]; its finish sets Status 1 and Option 91, and the next tick shows the set-down at 800 71.839
# 770 rot 63 in Grauberg [S]. The login there at Status 1 plays the zone-in 33, left open; the finish sets Status 2 and
# xi.maws.goToMaw sends the char to xi.maws.pastMaws[91]: the next tick shows Rolanberry Fields at -196.5 7.999 361.192
# rot 225. The login there at Status 2 completes the mission (Pillar of Hope current) and takes the four fragments
# (xi.wotg.helpers.removeMemoryFragments).
lists RolanberryFieldsS/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFieldsS/onEventFinish/703 GraubergS/onZoneIn/1 GraubergS/onEventUpdate/33 GraubergS/onEventFinish/33 RolanberryFields/onZoneIn/1
char zone=RolanberryFieldsS pos=-198,8,360 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForgetMeNot current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment2
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # 703
finish                                     # Status 1, Option the zone; set down in Grauberg [S]
tick 400
login open                                 # Status 1: 33
finish                                     # Status 2; goToMaw: the maw's other side
tick 400
login                                      # Status 2: completed, the fragments removed
